From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:59:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): renew window captures and lighten scroll recording

Shared render lifetime, draw observer and contact glow with Mihon 0076. Fresh-process folding lags even without recording; restart restores smoothness, so recorder overhead alone cannot explain the report. Renew only the public Haze source node at owner/window/density boundaries, releasing its captured layer while retaining list composition and position. Track migrated focus/draw observer owners and clean up listeners and queued work. Default to actual draw callbacks and a 2 s ordinary-priority sampler, without continuous Choreographer or FrameMetrics. Guard sessions and lifecycle bindings against old callbacks. Mihon format5 retains detailed recording as an explicit heavier option; Anikku format2 keeps a compact light-only adapter. Callback rate is not presented FPS; unavailable timing stays explicit. Brighten and widen the capsule contact core without changing gestures, typography or geometry. Device folding results remain to be verified.
